#Tüm senaryo

## Giriş yapıp, filtreleyip, sepete ekleyip checkout yapmak, geri dönüp çıkış yapmak
*User enters "login.standardUser" into "username" on "login" page.
*User enters "login.password" into "password" on "login" page.
*User clicks "loginButton" on "login" page.
*User should see "productsTitle" on "inventory" page.
* User selects "Name (A to Z)" from "sortDropdown" dropdown on "inventory" page.
* User clicks "anotherItem" on "inventory" page.
* User clicks "cartIcon" on "inventory" page.
* User should see "cartItem" on "cart" page.
*User clicks "checkoutButton" on "cart" page.
*User enters "SampleName" into "firstName" on "checkout" page.
*User enters "SampleLastName" into "lastName" on "checkout" page.
*User enters "34000" into "postalCode" on "checkout" page.
*User clicks "continueButton" on "checkout" page.
*User clicks "finishButton" on "checkout" page.
*User should see "completeMessage" on "checkout" page.
*User clicks "backHome" on "checkout" page.
*User clicks "menuButton" on "inventory" page.
*User clicks "logoutButton" on "inventory" page.
*User should see "loginTitle" on "login" page.

